# Design system (always on)

**Studio chrome** uses shared tokens/primitives **and Tailwind utility classes**. **Project apps** use per-project Tailwind `@theme` (optional inherit from Studio / package). See `docs/design/ui-primitives.md` § Project design system (locked).

## Packages (use these)

| Package | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-tokens` | `toCssVars`, `themeStyleBlock`, design-system → `@theme` |
| `@glassbox-studio/studio-theme-default` | Default Studio chrome `tokens.json` |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons` | Heroicons (remix/ui SVG factories) — see `components.mdc` |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-primitives` | Studio chrome atoms — typed class maps + remix/ui factories (ADR 0009) |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-components` | Studio chrome composed blocks (e.g. EmptyPanel) |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-layouts` | Studio shell zones / layout class maps (body / panels) |
| `@glassbox-studio/components` | Ideal-stack Live registry (section → container → …) |

**Ladder (Studio chrome):** `tokens → primitives → ui-components → ui-layouts`. No ghost packages — create only with a Studio import. Live registry stays `@glassbox-studio/components`. See ADR [0009](../../docs/adr/0009-ui-stack-packages.md) · `.scratch/ui-stack/`.

**Do not advertise** `ui-patterns` / `ui-shell` — those names are retired.

## Studio chrome styling (Tailwind only)

**Golden sentence:** Studio UI paint + layout live in Tailwind utilities — prefer `@glassbox-studio/ui-*` typed exports; leftover constants in `apps/studio/client/studio-ui-*.ts` shrink via extraction. **Never** `!important`. Custom CSS is debt — shrink it; do not grow it.

| Do | Don't |
| --- | --- |
| Add / extend `ui-primitives` / `ui-components` / `ui-layouts` (or shrink megasheet into them) | Invent BEM (`.as-foo__bar`, `.studio-panel__title`) |
| New chrome domain → package export + Studio import same PR | Grow megasheets when a package export should own it |
| Use theme-mapped utilities (`bg-surface`, `text-on-surface`, `border-border-bui`, `text-brand-600`, …) | Hand-roll layout/type/color in `studio.css` / `compact-shell.css` |
| Hook JS with `data-as-*` / `data-studio-*` attrs | Style via class names that only exist in `studio.css` |
| Container queries via Tailwind `@max-[…]` / `@[…]` when the pane is a container | CSS `@container` + `display: … !important` show/hide |
| Dual-mount + Tailwind `hidden` / `flex` | Compact FOUC sheets fighting Tailwind with `!important` |

### Forbidden

| Never | Why |
| --- | --- |
| New `!important` in `apps/studio/client/styles/**` | Specificity wars; Tailwind can’t win cleanly |
| New DeskPane / `#studio-wm-host` layout overrides in CSS | Fill = `wm.maximize` + host band tokens — see `shell/chrome-css.mdc` |
| New compact “attribute graph” layout in CSS | Shell bands + dual faces are Tailwind |

### When custom CSS is allowed (super rare — tokens / vendor only)

| Keep custom CSS for | Why |
| --- | --- |
| `:root` safe-area / dock **token definitions** (`--as-safe-*`, `--as-mobile-dock-*`) | `env()` once; utilities consume vars |
| 3rd-party token bridges (FullCalendar `.fc-*`, ProseMirror, Shiki overlay) | Nested vendor selectors we don’t own |
| True micro-interaction / keyframes (`.as-press`, `.as-pane-enter`) | `:active` / `@keyframes` |

If unsure: **Tailwind**. Only touch `studio.css` / `compact-shell.css` to **delete** debt or define a token — never to win a layout fight.

## Rules

| Do | Don't |
| --- | --- |
| Studio chrome: inject `--as-*` from theme tokens | Hardcode `#0f1115` / inline palette in Studio chrome |
| Projects: Tailwind `@theme` as the design system | Invent a forever parallel project token language |
| Opt-in inherit via `design.json` (`inherit: studio` or package) | Force every project to use Studio chrome theme |
| Design canvas = token atlas + components (not a 4th window) | Add a separate “Design System” window |
| Import primitives for chrome controls | Copy BrowserUI / shadcn buttons into `apps/studio` |
| Boolean prefs → **`studioSwitch`** (iOS pill) from `@glassbox-studio/ui-primitives` | On/Off text buttons, checkbox-as-toggle, or a second switch look |
| **Tabs / section chips stay at the top** of the pane (canvas strip, settings rail, in-window section tabs) | Bottom “pseudo-tabs” or window-launch chips that look like a second tab bar under content |

**Golden sentence (Studio chrome):** Window switchers and section tabs live **above** scrollable body — never a dock of tab-like buttons under the list.

**Icons:** Heroicons only — see `components.mdc` / `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons`.

## PWA / safe-area (notch + dock)

**Golden sentence:** Topbar pads for the notch. Mobile dock = thumb tab row only (same in browser + PWA). Never pad the dock for home-indicator.

| Token | Source | Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `--as-safe-top` (etc.) | `env(safe-area-inset-*)` on `:root` | **Topbar notch pad only** |
| `--as-mobile-dock-height` | `56px` | Tab row (icon + label) |
| `--as-mobile-dock-offset` | `= --as-mobile-dock-height` | Sheet / `#studio-wm-host` clearance — on `:root`. No bottom safe-area. |

**Single owner for token defs:** `apps/studio/client/styles/pwa-safe-area.css` (`:root` only). Compact **layout** → Tailwind shell classes + DeskPane maximize — not new `compact-shell.css` rules (`shell/chrome-css.mdc`).

| Edge | Always |
| --- | --- |
| Topbar | pad with `SAFE_*` / `var(--as-safe-top)` (no `!important`) |
| Bottom dock | Tab row only — **never** home-indicator / `pb-safe` / `--as-safe-bottom*` on the dock |
| Sheets / wm-host | host height `calc(100dvh − top − dock-offset)`; offset collapses while chat input focused |

**Utilities:** `SAFE_PT`, `SAFE_PB`, `SAFE_PL`, `SAFE_PR`, `SAFE_PT_TOPBAR` in `studio-ui-classes.ts`.

## Boot (Studio chrome)

```typescript
import tokens from "@glassbox-studio/studio-theme-default/tokens.json";
import { themeStyleBlock } from "@glassbox-studio/ui-tokens";
// inject :root { --as-color-* }
```

## Checklist (Studio UI change)

- [ ] Classes are Tailwind utilities or `studio-ui-classes.ts` constants — not new BEM
- [ ] **No new `!important`** anywhere in Studio styles
- [ ] No new layout/type/color in `studio.css` / `compact-shell.css` (delete debt only)
- [ ] Colors use `--as-*` / mapped utilities — not raw hex
- [ ] Tabs / section chips stay above scrollable body
- [ ] Underline tabs use reserved indicator (`TAB_UNDERLINE` / transparent idle) — no layout shift; section strips leave ≥12px air below (`SECTION_TABS`)
- [ ] Bordered peer sections use ≥ `gap-2` / `GAP_SECTION` (never kiss) — `surfaces.mdc`
- [ ] No elevation box-shadows on cards/menus — border + surface ladder — `surfaces.mdc`
- [ ] Rounded shells / Settings groups: inset ≥ radius; no flush Save — `surfaces.mdc`
- [ ] Rounded table/directory pager uses body gutter `px-*` (clears corner arc) — `components.mdc`
- [ ] Drawers/sheets: header X only — no top grabber — `components.mdc`
- [ ] Create-new forms start collapsed — `components.mdc`
- [ ] Interactive `input` / `textarea` / `select` ≥ `text-[16px]` — `components.mdc`
- [ ] Boolean chrome prefs use `studioSwitch` (iOS pill) — not On/Off text
- [ ] Fixed edge chrome uses `--as-safe-*` / `SAFE_*` (notch + home indicator OK in PWA)
- [ ] DeskPane / compact / chat fill follows `shell/chrome-css.mdc`
- [ ] Document-flow — general G1–G10; Studio chrome also S1–S5 — `natural-document-flow.mdc`
- [ ] Content panes = flex-col; grid only as outer shell — `layout.mdc`

